stomer success role; Philippines is explicitly an accepted location. Own enterprise customer adoption, configurations, training and account health. Prefers 5+ years of B2B SaaS customer success and complex product expertise. Up to 10% customer travel is required.","reviewed":false}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(id) do nothing;
